* &lt;a title="The Hero of Ages" href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/3362870.The_Hero_of_Ages"&gt;The Hero of Ages&lt;/a&gt; *&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</dc:description>
